  "title": "Plant\u2011Based Protein Bar \u2013 White Chocolate Concept (Cocoa Butter Constraint Not Met)",
  "justification_summary": "The formulation uses only ingredients from the validated candidate set and meets all hard constraints that can be satisfied with the available ingredients: it is dairy\u2011free, contains at least 5\u202f% protein (49.995\u202f% soy\u2011protein), has sugar \u2264\u202f30\u202f% (5\u202f% sugar), and the total formulation sums to 100\u202f%. However, the hard requirement of \u2265\u202f25\u202f% cocoa butter cannot be met because cocoa butter is not present in the validated candidate set and new ingredients cannot be introduced per rule\u202f1. Therefore the formulation satisfies all other constraints but does not meet the cocoa butter specification.",
